OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCoastal      
OL,6,Fareas will see clear spells tonight,   
OL,7,Fwith low cloud further inland. It will 
OL,8,Ffeel rather cold with widespread frost 
OL,9,Fdeveloping and the odd freezing fog    
OL,10,Fpatch in valleys.                      
OL,12,CThursday:FAfter a frosty start,        
OL,13,FThursday will be cloudy and dry for    
OL,14,Fmost, and remaining chilly. Overnight  
OL,15,Fa front arrives, bringing wetter,      
OL,16,Fwindier and milder conditions.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
