OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday   
OL,6,Fand the weekend will likely be         
OL,7,Funsettled with rain and cloud between  
OL,8,Fbrighter spells, and breezy winds near 
OL,9,Fcoasts. Generally chilly inland with   
OL,10,Fovernight frost, but milder near       
OL,11,Fcoasts.                                
